              rdfs:comment "The class MA_Master designates named human individuals recognized for their achievements in martial arts. Instances include historical practitioners, founders, and teachers. Concrete examples: Lam Sai Wing (林世榮). DISAMBIGUATION: A person's name is always MA_Master, NEVER MA_style or MA_system. The name of a whole art or tradition is MA_system. A lineage branch is MA_style."@en ;
