                                 ] ;
                 rdfs:comment "MA_Institute represents social agents specifically involved in the activities of training, transmission, and assessment of martial arts, e.g. a school, clan, sect, or athletic association. Instances of this class typically have a physical location, represented by the property located at to relate to a place, accordingly subsuming the CIDOC-CRM assertions about E53 Place and P156 occupies."@en ;
                 rdfs:label "MA_Institute"@en ;
