                               owl:someValuesFrom mao:E53_place
                             ] ;
             rdfs:comment "The class MA_style conceptualizes a specific lineage, branch, or school WITHIN a martial arts system. Concrete examples: Lam Family Hung Kuen (林家洪拳), Yongchun White Crane (永春白鶴拳). DISAMBIGUATION: MA_style is a branch of an MA_system. A whole art like Hung Kuen is MA_system; a family lineage within it is MA_style. A person's name is never MA_style."@en ;
             rdfs:label "MA_Style"@en ;
