                rdfs:subClassOf mao:E73.Information_Object ;
                rdfs:comment "A formalised curriculum specifying which forms, techniques, and grading requirements constitute a complete course of study within a martial arts system or institute. Not all traditional systems have a standardised syllabus."@en ;
